# Temperance marker — main branch (post-scope-e-merge bump)
- date: 2026-08-30
- branch: main
- goal: prepare v0.1.0 tag + publish per operator Option A pick
- scope-decision:
  - right-thing: single MINOR 0.1.0 bump combining scope-b1 (PR #36) + scope-e (PR #39)
    per RFC L3 precedent (adopter migration ships MINOR) + operator confirmation
  - right-way: manual CHANGELOG merge → npm run bump minor → tag v0.1.0 → push tag →
    operator dispatches publish workflow (per ADR-004 + guardrails)
